# Project conventions

## Frontend

- TypeScript (no `any`)
- pnpm
- Next.js App Router
- Prefer Server Components
- Tailwind CSS

## Backend

- Python with uv
- FastAPI
- Pydantic schemas for API contracts
- Keep business logic in services; routers handle HTTP only
